OL,3,GNEWSALlamas, lizards and spiders to be
OL,4,Ablessed at cathedral
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom llamas to lizards, and sheep to
OL,7,Fstick insects, a rather unusual
OL,8,Fcongregation will gather at church this
OL,9,Fweekend.
OL,11,FWorcester Cathedral has invited
OL,12,Fcreatures great and small from across
OL,13,Fthe region to an animal blessing.
OL,15,FIn previous years the congregation has
OL,16,Fincluded tarantulas, fish, guineafowl,
OL,17,Fdogs and cats.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
