OL,3,GNEWSALlamas, lizards and spiders to be
OL,4,Ablessed at cathedral
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanon Kimberly Bohan, who will be
OL,7,Ftaking the service, said churches had
OL,8,Fbeen blessing animals "for hundreds of
OL,9,Fyears" and said it was "natural" to
OL,10,F"bless what we find to be a blessing".
